wait 1

play "slice.ogg" 1.0

show "white.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.1,linear) normal
wait 0.05

play "slip.ogg" 1.0

show "2black.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.3,linear) normal

wait 2.0

play "cut.ogg" 1.0

show "nihil/nihil_2_cut3.jpg" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 1.4:1.4 fade(0.05,linear) normal
show "black_left.png" 0:0.5 0:0.5 1.0:1.0 fade(0,linear) normal
wait 0
move "black_left.png" -600:0 0 sineout
wait 0.4

say "My arm... leaves my body once again.
I look down at the little fiend that took it.
She looks not at me, but at the other: \"Saya\"."

hide "nihil/nihil_2_cut3.jpg" fade(0.1,linear)
hide "black_left.png" fade(0.1,linear)

play "heavy_slap.ogg" 1

wait 0.6 clear

play "catastrophe_impact_c.ogg" 1

say "Insolent.
As she turns back to look in my direction, I take my remaining hand
and strike the back of it across her face."



hide "white.png" fade(0.1,linear)
hide "2black.png" fade(0.1,linear)

show "catastrophe/cat_3_2.jpg" 1:1 1:1 1.4:1.4 fade(0.5,linear) normal

play "echo_cut.ogg" 0.4

wait 2.4 clear
play "fracture2_epilogue.ogg" 0.2
wait 1.4

say "She hurtles away. I lean backward to avoid the blade of her scythe.
She attempts to stop herself with that blade at the world's edge
and fails, tumbling into the dark beneath us."

hide "catastrophe/cat_3_2.jpg" fade(0.1,linear)
show "white50.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(2,linear) normal

play "humanSnapFinger_echo.ogg" 1

say "I flex my fingers, and after—I snap them to take time away.
I look into the world as I move forth."

show "catastrophe/cat_3_3.jpg" 1:0.5 1:0.5 0.42:0.42 fade(3,linear) normal
show "2black_left.png" 0:0.5 0.05:0.5 1.0:1.0 fade(0,linear) normal
show "3black.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.3,linear) normal
show "2white.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.1,linear) normal
wait 0
move "3black.png"  -1000:0 0 sineout

wait 0.1
hide "white50.png" fade(4,linear)
hide "2white.png" fade(4,linear)

play "shimmer_loop.ogg" 0.0 loop
volume "shimmer_loop.ogg" 0.5 4.0

say "Arcaea... I said that you were dead.
Are you another ghost like the girls here, lingering on?
That: it would answer many questions I have had."

say "But you should simply rest.
You've lingered long enough.
And you vowed to do so: to rest, and yet it seems still here you are..."

say "An undignified god that cannot keep a promise.
It is a shameful thing."

say "...I land between Saya and Vita. I bring my missing limb back.
Vita, Vita... this shameful place ill suits one as precious as you.
And, why have you come out—?"

show "5black.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.2,linear) normal

say "My eyes widen once again.
At—the sight of a very special ghost behind her.
...The hairs along my body stand on end."

hide "catastrophe/cat_3_3.jpg" fade(0,linear)
hide "2black_left.png" fade(0,linear)
hide "3black.png" fade(0,linear)
wait 0
hide "5black.png" fade(0.1,linear)
wait 0

stop "shimmer_loop.ogg" 8.0

unload_textures

show "catastrophe/cat_3_4_2.jpg" 1:0.5 1:0.5 1:1 fade(0.1,linear) normal
show "6white.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.1,linear) normal
show "catastrophe/cat_3_4.jpg" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.6 0.7:0.7 fade(0.1,linear) normal
show "2white.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.1,linear) normal
show "catastrophe/cat_3_4_5.jpg" 1:0.2 1:0.2 1:1 fade(0.1,linear) normal
show "3white.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.1,linear) normal
show "4black.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0,linear) normal

move "catastrophe/cat_3_4_5.jpg" 150:0 0 sineout

show "catastrophe/old_light.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 0.77:0.77 fade(5,sinout) normal

play "flash_build.ogg" 1

say "Now, now... what plan is this—?"

play "flash_hit.ogg" 1

hide "4black.png" fade(0.1,linear)
hide "catastrophe/old_light.png" fade(0.1,linear)
hidetextbox
wait 0.5

play "un_mini.ogg" 0.4 loop

wait 0.5

move "catastrophe/cat_3_4_5.jpg" -100:0 1.2 sineout

wait 0.1
hide "3white.png" fade(1,linear)

wait 1.1
move "catastrophe/cat_3_4_5.jpg" -50:0 5 outquad
wait 4.8

hide "catastrophe/cat_3_4_5.jpg" fade(0.1,linear)
wait 0.1

wait 1.0
hide "2white.png" fade(3,linear)

wait 2.0

say "...! ..."

say "...This... is..."

say "...mockery?"

say "\"Ha... Ahahaha!!\""

say "Cloaking this common echo of the dead and gone...
...are those: Arcaea's strings."

hide "catastrophe/cat_3_4.jpg" fade(0.1,linear)

move "catastrophe/cat_3_4_2.jpg" 0:-150 7 sineout

wait 0.1

hide "6white.png" fade(2,linear)

say "I look at her: at Saya in the standard way to view reality...
...and I can't help but laugh, to be surprised again...!"

play "sword_draw_delayed.ogg" 1

show "white.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.1,linear) normal
wait 0.05
show "2black.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.3,linear) normal

say "Perfectly composed—
Saya moves to strike me, and for the first time in an age—
why, I must show up...! And first, as in Arcaea—I will use \"Arcaea\" to fight you."

hidetextbox
hide "white.png" fade(0,linear)
hide "catastrophe/cat_3_4_2.jpg" fade(0,linear)
wait 0
hide "2black.png" fade(0.1,linear)
wait 0

unload_textures

wait 1.5

show "catastrophe/cat_4_1_2.jpg" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 1:1 fade(0.1,linear) normal
show "4white.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.1,linear) normal

show "catastrophe/cat_4_1_1.jpg" 1:1 1:1 1:1 fade(0.2,linear) normal
move "catastrophe/cat_4_1_1.jpg" 150:0 0 sineout

wait 0
move "catastrophe/cat_4_1_1.jpg" -100:0 2 sineout

show "white.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.1,linear) normal
wait 0.1
hide "white.png" fade(2,linear)

play "sword_big_a.ogg" 1

wait 0.4
wait 1.5
move "catastrophe/cat_4_1_1.jpg" -50:0 5 outquad

play "teleport_out.ogg" 1

say "I draw up a line of glass between myself and her. Her blade meets it—
and suddenly, she vanishes, but I am able to see her...
...flash to the air above me and my side, moving to strike again...!"

show "white40.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.1,linear) normal
wait 0.1
hide "white40.png" fade(0.5,linear)

play "sword_big_c.ogg" 1

say "My...!
She cuts down as I lift a hand, and ripple the air to try and stop her.
Her blade cuts through—I step back and in a spiral—!"

hide "catastrophe/cat_4_1_1.jpg" fade(0.1,linear)
wait 0.1 clear
hide "4white.png" fade(2,linear)

play "sword_fire_a.ogg" 1

say "—She falls, turns, and suddenly—
my leg feels like a tree stricken by lightning
and set afire. What's that?"

say "I glance down.
That mad weapon is now piercing my foot to the earth
and Saya has let it go. And... white flames crawl upward! My..."

say "This...
is no good, is it...!"

hide "catastrophe/cat_4_1_2.jpg" fade(2,linear)

say "I growl and resist my own undoing by the sword. There's unraveling in me...
I reach for it, and it lashes back at me with fire.
Saya has vanished already as I look to find her. Vita is here instead."

play "catastrophe_teleport_a.ogg" 1

say "She disappears before I can speak and finally I see what it is that Saya is doing—
Changing space here and here, and there and there through glass...
taking Vita somewhere that she must imagine is \"safe\"..."

play "sword_pull_reject.ogg" 1

say "I focus. I pull the sword from my body. Its grip continues to reject me.
It's like a Seeker's power... and my foot is not immediately healing...
Just what is this scheme...? What are you thinking, little and dying god?"

play "sword_call.ogg" 1

say "I lose sight of Vita... Then, the sword in my hand is lost; returned to Saya?
Yes... When next I see it, it is in Saya's hands again, and she is at my back...
Ha... Oh... if that strikes my neck or head..."

unload_textures


play "catastrophe_teleport_b.ogg" 1

show "catastrophe/cat_4_1_3c.jpg" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 1.5:1.5 fade(1,linear) normal
show "white.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.1,linear) normal
wait 0.05 clear
hide "white.png" fade(6,linear)
wait 2
play "catastrophe_impact_c.ogg" 0.4

say "In a flash, it goes above my shoulders—
It cuts through stopping time—it's stopped only quickly by my commanding the air.
A ripple pounds the earth. I breathe out."

say "...You want to kill me so badly?
We've only just met."

show "catastrophe/cat_4_1_3.jpg" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 0.7:0.7 fade(2.4,linear) normal

play "ominous_swell.ogg" 1

say "Fine. Let death and dance intertwine then.
Your eye meets mine, and mine yours.
You and I, Saya, in the blighted lands of Arcaea."

hidetextbox
wait 2

stop "un_mini.ogg" 2

wait 2
